{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"31f1b3152f6ce6a3eb57d85c0e5a7191e9d2fcb22af4ca2920661472004d2c1d","digest":{"component_or_area":"Operation-scoped configuration and provider-auth composition (RP-04)","key_entities":["OperationSnapshot","ProviderSession","PydanticAIRunner","GitRuntime","LLMRuntime","BridgeRuntime","SecretStr","SecretBytes","REBAR_ROOT","REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH","REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY","REBAR_OPERATION_SNAPSHOT_SHADOW","check_config_reads.py","ADR 0098","RP-01","resolve_with_sources"],"problem_keywords":["configuration resolution","provider authentication","credential composition","operation scope","ambient state reread","static credentials","identity fallback","op-cert startup","auth lifecycle","environment isolation"],"propositions":["Configuration must resolve once per operation boundary following explicit input > environment > project config > user config > schema default precedence, with repository root resolved separately and all paths interpreted relative to the winning root.","Every operation must receive an immutable, serializable, non-secret OperationSnapshot projection that does not reread environment, files, cwd, or global config during the operation; subsequent operations observe changes from the new boundary.","Provider-native auth and session bindings must be injected only through RP-01's existing ProviderSession builders, preserving budget, retry history, cache/accounting, typed exhaustion, artifacts, tracing, usage, and failure behavior without arbitrary client/runner injection.","Static secrets must be represented as non-serializable Pydantic SecretStr/SecretBytes carriers visible only in sending adapters, never exposed through global environ mutation, repr, serialization, logs, or subprocess siblings.","Op-cert must enforce exactly one of REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH or REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY, validate before service work, use a process-owned 0700/0600 copy, and have no runtime SSM/boto3 dependency; keys rotate on restart/redeploy only.","A portable AST ownership gate must derive config/credential names from authoritative registries, reject direct/aliased config reads and backend reloads below approved seams, permit only exact path/symbol+rationale exceptions, and reach zero legacy exceptions at cutover."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787006964031436001,"uuid":"3a26f577-e7b2-4661-bb91-0d6fd1418aff"}